<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Simsen Metals shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Simsen Metals shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of nonferrous metals trader Simsen Metals (Holdings) Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Shares of Simsen Metals rose HK$0.12 or 12.90 percent to HK$1.05 prior to the trading suspension. Volume was 2.53 million shares worth HK$2.50 million.</p>
<p>The company said earlier on Friday that it was in acquisition talks.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
